{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My life is ordinary, nothing is particularly good, nothing is particularly bad, just a simple and happy ordinary life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought I would just live my college life like this, until that day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Oh my god, there is a cow!!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Your Cow&quot; is a youth love theme Galgame, the game type is a visual novel, players can read the plot text by clicking on the screen to display the dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a single-character single ending, does not include choice branches, the total playing time is about 2.5 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 4 beautiful independent dynamic CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine is fully voiced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine's dynamic portrait</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: This game is a Galgame (AVG-text game), which does not contain any other gameplay and system, just like reading a novel, you can only click on the screen and read text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note 2: All the characters in the game are adults, and the characters, stories, places, plots, worlds and other forms of expression involved are all fictional, and have no connection with any characters or events in reality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764120?t=1756260842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764120?t=1756260842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764120/2edcc7d0fa7ccf687c9361541d8f6553642ba4b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756260842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764120/2edcc7d0fa7ccf687c9361541d8f6553642ba4b6/capsule_184x69.jp